                                "example_id": "c65b88a8-acfd-4c4b-951a-3bc7967f8fd4",
                                "sense_id": "322abc51-1b5d-3824-bae9-69927c40c907",
                                "text": "Thus, in the present digressive and droll performance, [for Peter is ever digressive as well as diverting,] every thing finds a place that seems, in random succession, to have occureed to the multiferous mind of the playful poet, when he sat down to write ."
                            },
